- one header-comment sentence ('Start reviewing is offered only where the document machine allows `start_review` (DOS-031).');
- one import line;
- the Start branch.

Prettier left the `) : (` fragment with Save / This reading is right / Give it up unchanged, and rematch, approve, reject, commit() and the Bill no. / Amount inputs are not in the diff. R1-R4 were not touched.

